asr-000669
00:54:49.280 --> 00:55:01.120
Rep. Brian Poe: And his body was buried somewhere in Somalia. And the family, until now, is still requesting that his body be returned to the Philippines. Is there any update on Sam De La Cruz?

asr-000670
