asr-000674
00:55:36.600 --> 00:55:44.420
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: He died in July 2018 due to cardiopulmonary arrest back in 2018.

asr-000675
00:55:45.220 --> 00:55:49.080
