asr-000686
00:56:49.280 --> 00:56:52.700
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Since we also do not have a mission in Somalia.

asr-000687
00:56:53.160 --> 00:57:02.300
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: And at that time, they had not received an official reply from the government of Somalia.

asr-000688
