asr-000690
00:57:19.280 --> 00:57:26.180
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Uh, and had worked to secure permits and funding for exhumation of the remains.

asr-000691
00:57:26.180 --> 00:57:33.180
